{"scope":"rt-bec0df3d17","css":".rt-bec0df3d17 p.MsoNormal, .rt-bec0df3d17 li.MsoNormal, .rt-bec0df3d17 div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; font-size:10.0pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;}\n.rt-bec0df3d17 h1 {mso-style-link:\"Heading 1 Char\"; margin:0cm; page-break-after:avoid; font-size:16.0pt; font-family:\"Times New Roman\",serif;}\n.rt-bec0df3d17 h3 {mso-style-link:\"Heading 3 Char\"; margin:0cm; text-align:center; page-break-after:avoid; font-size:12.0pt; font-family:\"Courier New\";}\n.rt-bec0df3d17 h4 {mso-style-link:\"Heading 4 Char\"; margin:0cm; page-break-after:avoid; font-size:14.0pt; font-family:\"Courier New\";}\n.rt-bec0df3d17 span.Heading1Char {mso-style-name:\"Heading 1 Char\"; mso-style-link:\"Heading 1\"; font-weight:bold;}\n.rt-bec0df3d17 span.Heading3Char {mso-style-name:\"Heading 3 Char\"; mso-style-link:\"Heading 3\"; font-family:\"Courier New\"; font-weight:bold;}\n.rt-bec0df3d17 span.Heading4Char {mso-style-name:\"Heading 4 Char\"; mso-style-link:\"Heading 4\"; font-family:\"Courier New\"; font-weight:bold;}\n.rt-bec0df3d17 div.WordSection1 {}","html":"<div class=WordSection1>\r\n\r\n<p class=MsoNormal><span style='position:relative;z-index:251657728;left:-52px;\r\ntop:14px;width:994px;height:16px'><img width=795 height=2\r\nsrc=\"data:image\/gif;base64,R0lGODlh4gMCAHcAMSH+GlNvZnR3YXJlOiBNaWNyb3NvZnQgT2ZmaWNlACH5BAEAAAAALAAAAADiAwIAgAAAAAAAAAJGBHKJq83vIpyy0msz3rrz74XgKJbkaaboqrbs68bwLNf0bef4rvf87wsChwaiUYg8KpPMpbMJfUqj1Km1ir1qs9ytNwEoAAA7\"><\/span><b><u><span lang=EN-US><span\r\n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/b><\/p>\r\n\r\n<h3><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'><span\r\n style='text-decoration:none'>&nbsp;<\/span><\/span><\/u><\/h3>\r\n\r\n<br clear=ALL>\r\n\r\n<h3><u><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bookman Old Style\",serif'>DEPARTMENT\r\nOF PATHOLOGY<\/span><\/u><\/h3>\r\n\r\n<h1><span lang=EN-US style='font-size:14.0pt;font-family:\"Bo